WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.330
Won’t leave

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.080
without a dropkick on her!

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.250
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
-She summoned me, the evil god.
-Evil god!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.770
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.650
-I can’t go back to Hell!
-Sister...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.360
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw!

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.280
If you go too far,

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:46.280
I’ll slice you up completely!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.540
Your halo!
Must get it back!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:52.660
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.880
-To attack her from behind!
-You’re so mean.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:01.130
I’ll never give up.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.760
Yurine, you’re off your guard!

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:06.930
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.850
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.270
Can’t leave Earth

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.360
without a dropkick on her!

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.570
But until then,

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.490
-let’s all have fun together!
-Yeah!

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.710
Dinner's ready!

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:38.080
I'm serving curry tonight.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:43.760
Nice, pork cutlet curry.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.760
-Let's eat.
-Let's eat!

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.140
-All done.
-All done.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.320
Curry for dinner, huh?
Looks good!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.150
THE NIGHT AFTER

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.410
Curry for dinner again!

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:11.030
It's hamburger steak curry tonight.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.410
Curry's best on the second day.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.210
-Let's eat.
-Let's eat!

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.830
-All done.
-All done!

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.670
THE NIGHT AFTER.
AGAIN.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.880
That's right! It's curry three nights in a row!

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:28.930
That's a bit excessive...

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:32.850
We shouldn't be doing this,
even for just 20 minutes.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.770
Not to worry.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.600
This is the last time.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:40.270
Still, it's three days in a row...

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:42.900
Rock, paper...

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.570
-Scissors.
-Scissors.

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.320
I didn't mean to win.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:50.200
Jashin-chan, you just won

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.330
the privilege of getting out the mayo.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.080
Yes! Right away!

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.830
-Here you go.
-Thanks.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:02:59.710
YURINE

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.090
Is-- Is that for your curry?

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:09.720
Of course.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.720
Mayo on curry?

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.720
That's sacrilege!

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.020
They really go well together.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.480
Here, try it.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.580
-It's delicious!
-See?

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.490
But why? How is that possible?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.200
Can't go wrong with mayo.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:42.290
That didn't answer my question.
Nevertheless, it's good.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.840
No doubt about it.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.760
Curry and mayo,
the winning combo.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:49.470
No doubt!

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:50.800
That's it!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:54.970
-I'm making curry again tomorrow!
-Again?

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:03.980
Look at that.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:07.150
So, you can buy
these things on Amazon.

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.570
You're really making curry again?

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.870
Yup. It's chicken curry tonight.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:17.490
If you power walk

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:22.710
I live five minutes away
From the station.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.090
The katar or chakram...

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.460
Which do you think is sharper?

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.720
Hey.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.890
Are you listening to me?

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.430
What?

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.180
She disappeared.

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:43.810
What's going on?

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:45.940
What just happened?

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:47.480
Let me explain!

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.530
While Jashin-chan
was stirring the curry,

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:54.660
she unintentionally formed
a magic circle

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.950
and sacrificed the chicken!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:02.750
Furthermore, her random song matched up with the spell
that opened the gates to the other dimension.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.250
Five minutes away
From the station

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:09.340
Jashin-chan was sucked into a warp!

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.470
Where am I?

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:16.050
Looks familiar, but...

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.310
The entrance to Hell!

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:23.020
Welcome to Hell
Free parking available in 666 miles

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:27.400
How did stirring the curry
get me here?

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.520
Maybe...!

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:31.820
The kitchen exploded...

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.360
BANG

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:36.160
And killed Yurine?

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.780
Oh, no!

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:44.620
No, if that's the case,
I'd be dead too.

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.790
I don't get what happened.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:50.040
But if all the conditions aren't met,

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:53.090
I'm just gonna get turned away.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:57.760
Hey, she looks like Jashin-chan,
all grown up.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:02.930
Only the fact that she's half-viper.
Otherwise, not at all.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:06.310
She's identical to you!
She must be a relative.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:16.490
Tiny Medusa, Minos...

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.320
And me!

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.950
Seems like she knows us.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.830
See? She's a relative.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.160
Are you my relative?

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.210
Where are you from?

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:33.630
I was cooking in the human world just a minute ago.
Before I knew it, I was here.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.090
The human world?

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:39.970
Isn't the human world completely vacant
because of the great flood?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:45.430
The great flood...?
The one from 7000 years ago?

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.770
Noah!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:52.440
Does that mean
I went back in time?

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:59.450
So, you're saying that you're Jashin-chan
from the future?

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.990
I'm sure you don't believe it.

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:03.990
I believe you.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:07.710
Your eyes don't lie.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:10.250
Medusa, as adorable as you are,

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.090
don't let some fool deceive you.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.010
-Hey, miss!
-Yeah?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.220
What am I like in the future?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.890
That flat chest of yours

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:26.640
is about triple the size!

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:31.020
Triple the size?
That sounds powerful!

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.400
You are strong.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:34.320
But, not as strong as me.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.030
What about me?

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.910
-You're always working.
-Really?

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:44.910
One of the most wonderful inventions
of the future is the ATM...

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.790
Me! What about me?

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.210
-This.
-What?

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.500
You're looking straight at it.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.670
No way!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.670
I was planning on becoming
a lot cooler!

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:02.930
In your dreams!

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:09.310
This is bad. I have no idea
how to get back to the human world.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.810
Leave that to us!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:16.480
We'll send you back
with our secret ritual.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.280
Curry's up!

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:26.740
DROPKICK ON MY DEVIL!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.960
Now that's some fiery curry.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.340
I remember this.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:47.100
But it's not gonna work.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.890
We tried so many times.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.100
We always failed.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.690
Look, she disappeared.

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:00.110
Did it work?

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.160
Did you wish really hard
for her return?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.530
-Nope! I was dreaming about dinner!
-What?

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:10.120
I'm starving!
I wonder what's for dinner tonight.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.790
I hope it's curry.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.080
Curry? That sounds good.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.330
-I love chicken curry.
-Is she okay?

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.630
Beef curry's my favorite,
hands down.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:20.880
-Hey, that makes you a cannibal.
-Shut up.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.550
DEVILISHLY DELICIOUS NAAN

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.130
Ouch.

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.140
What?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.100
Finally, I'm back.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.560
Where in the world have you been?

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:35.270
One minute, you're gone.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:38.060
Next thing you know,
you're on the table

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.780
destroying all the food.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:46.030
Did you know that curry stains
are impossible to get out?

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.330
Amazon delivery!

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:57.130
I just ordered a minute ago.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.460
And it's already here.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:03.420
Thank goodness for Prime.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:09.350
They're both really sharp.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.180
I'm shocked you kept
on eating dinner

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:16.310
when I suddenly vanished
in front of your eyes!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.270
Curry again?

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.270
Looks good!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:23.610
Patience is key
when it comes to love and curry!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.330
August is almost over.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.330
But it's still really hot.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.130
Don't ignore me. Say something.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:47.880
That shaved ice from the stand
was awesome!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:51.260
Yeah! The lemon flavor was crazy good.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.770
I wanna eat shaved ice!

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.560
Was there a shaved ice stand
around here?

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:59.560
Could that be it?

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.020
SHAVED ICE

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:05.360
Come and enjoy some shaved ice!

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:08.070
Hey, it's Yusa and Koji!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:11.200
Hey, you two. How are you?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.740
It was you guys.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:16.410
It's the off-season in Hell right now.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.540
So we came out here to work.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.540
-It's pretty good money.
-What?

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.710
You get rich off shaved ice?

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.550
Jashin-chan...

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.630
They're only able to make profit
because there's no overhead

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:32.050
in producing the ice and syrups.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:33.930
It won't be the same for you.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:38.270
Too late.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:44.900
Brain freeze! That's cold!

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:48.740
I'm gonna make a killing
off shaved ice too!

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.070
If Yusa's selling theirs
for 200 yen...

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.660
I'll sell it for 300!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:00.580
Dummy. They'll all go for the cheaper one.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.960
I'd like a melon one please!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:05.550
-Sold!
-No way.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.670
Here they come!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:13.430
This heat must be getting to everyone.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:20.230
This shaved ice machine
is really inefficient.

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:25.940
They're able to produce ice
in a split second.

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:31.990
Damn it! Those brats!

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:37.540
I'll operate three machines,
with hands and my tail!

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:39.500
Hilarious

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:45.130
Head pain caused by eating
shaved ice is also called

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:47.090
an "ice cream" headache.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.840
That's an official medical term.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:54.760
I scream after that first bite
of shaved ice!

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:58.260
JASHIN SHAVED ICE

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:02.640
It's completely dead now.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.310
They still have a huge line.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:12.530
Damn you, Koji!
I'll change your name to Mimori

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.450
so it's harder for you
to establish character.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:18.660
That's a pretty obscure reference.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:22.210
Wow, it's so light!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.540
This is heavenly!

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.290
How ironic, they're devils.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:32.800
The cheap ice, flavored syrups,

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.180
and toy-like shaved ice machine

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:39.060
can't compete with their
light and powdery ice.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:42.730
I must obtain the best ingredient to win!

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:48.810
I'm going on a quest for natural ice
from Mount Fuji!

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.080
The air is so thin.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.000
But I made it to the sacred place.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.340
I hope...

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.960
I find Jashin-chan soon.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.590
Ice, ice, ice!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:20.970
I'm fully stocked.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:23.680
Where did all that energy come from?

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.100
To achieve the finest ice...

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:31.770
I got a professional shaved ice
machine and expensive syrups!

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:35.570
-Voila!
-Where did you get the money?

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:40.450
Medusa, I bought all of this
with your money

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.370
so I could win.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.000
-Good luck.
-She died?

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.330
In order to bring Yusa
and Koji down,

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.000
I'm selling mine

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.040
for only five yen!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.340
You can kiss profit goodbye.

00:14:57.050 --> 00:15:00.640
I'll produce better-quality ice to beat them!

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:04.140
-That wasn't her initial objective.
-Fluffy, fluffy ice!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:09.270
Yusa and Koji, you guys

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.150
are about to be annihilated!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.690
Now, humans...

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:17.950
Come and buy
the ultimate shaved ice!

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.780
Not so fast, viper girl.

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:25.660
You don't have a permit
to do business here.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.410
A permit?

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:31.630
We have our permit, of course.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.790
PERMIT

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:36.090
You can't do business here.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.130
You'd better come with us.

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:43.260
I see you're half-viper...

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:46.850
-but your upper half could make you rich.
-What?

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:49.690
Well, actually,
I've got a viper fetish.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.230
I think she wants you to save her.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:58.360
No, that's the "Don't worry, I've got this" look.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.320
Come on over! It's hot and fresh!

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:02.530
One please!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:03.700
CURRY SHAVED ICE

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:11.790
All right. That should do it.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.590
Wow, this is heavy.

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:22.220
I've got no stamina
since I haven't been eating.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:28.770
Where did this random huge rock come from?

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:33.520
If only I had my halo, I could turn that into bread.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:41.530
That's enough water
for today and tomorrow.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.780
How did that get ripped?

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.120
Pekola, I found you.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.130
You're the angel apprentice.

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:57.550
That's me, Poporon.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:00.840
But I'm a full-fledged angel now,
thank you very much.

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:08.470
The angel radar app didn't sense you.
So that was quite a feat.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.680
As you can see, I lost my halo.

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:14.650
So there was no way
for me to contact Heaven.

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.770
That's why the radar didn't work.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.610
I've been dreaming of this day.

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:25.570
I can finally go back to Heaven now!

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:29.740
When I go back, I'm gonna relax in a hot bath.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:35.460
Nourish myself with nectar and a feast.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:39.420
Then I'll fall into a deep sleep in a warm bed.

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:42.760
What are you waiting for?
Take me back to Heaven!

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.760
Good-bye, Pekola.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.900
Stop, don't move.

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:59.400
What's going on?

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.860
Here's another one!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:04.400
Ready? Yakisoba!

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.870
But why?

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:22.880
I'm currently serving as your substitute,
since you're missing.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:29.260
But if you return,
I go back to being an apprentice again.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:34.350
That'll put an end to my glory days
of bossing other angels around.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:37.390
I don't follow at all.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:40.400
You're as thick as a brick!

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:46.360
As long as you stay out of Heaven,
I'll be treated like royalty!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:51.370
So you're not here to bring me back...

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.290
I'm here to get rid of you for good.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.870
Just when I thought...

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:01.750
I was about to go home.

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.050
How could this be...?

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:10.300
I'm so lucky to find you
stripped of angel powers.

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:12.140
Now you're just a piece of meat.

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:14.060
-Meat...
-No, more like waste.

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:16.270
This is gonna be a piece of cake.

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:21.360
I always had a feeling
she wasn't an angel at heart.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:23.480
But this is just ridiculous.

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:27.700
I'm not an angel because I'm worthy of it...

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:31.820
I'm an angel because
I was born to become one.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.870
Hey, what's up?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.830
Is this a bad time?

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.630
A devil?

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:45.590
Yurine sent me to deliver this curry to you .

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.090
Curry!

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:51.390
But I can't accept charity from a witch.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:55.140
-What? You can't eat my curry?
-Hey!

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:58.060
-It's out of this world good.
-Hey!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:19:59.940
You're in the way!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:03.230
I'll finish you later.
Get out of the way!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.570
You call that curry?
It's all potatoes.

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:13.320
Now get out of my sight.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.080
Tastes good!

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.450
Curry's best the second day.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.460
Day three of simmering in the pot.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.590
Garam masala!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:32.680
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:34.640
Die!

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:39.560
How could you do that to my curry?

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:42.270
Waste human lives all you want!

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:46.070
But don't you ever waste precious food!

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:48.900
-Give me the packing tape!
-Okay.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:51.820
Take that!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:21:01.960
Kazuyo, this is revenge
for breaking up with me.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.000
WILL

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:06.540
Dear God, please forgive me
for wasting this life.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:21.810
I don't wanna die!
Save me, Mommy!

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.480
No sight of Poporon...

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:32.240
Who was that anyway?

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.200
-Oh, well--
-Never mind, I don't care.

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:37.620
I'm famished from running so hard.

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:39.410
Let's go.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:44.210
Yurine won't believe my story,
that a weirdo spilled my curry.

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:48.710
Rather than having her send me back out,
let's just eat together.

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:51.460
But it's a devil's...

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:54.930
Stop making such a fuss. Let's go.

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:58.470
You can't let my curry go to waste.

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:05.940
I hate to admit it,
but I was saved by this devil today.

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:34.550
Dropkick on her! Yeah her!
I’ll take you down again!

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:39.470
Hate you!
Love doesn’t exist in this world

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:44.810
Fear the dropkick!
An Angel looks for her halo

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:49.230
As she starves to death!

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:51.860
It’s a love and hate relationship,

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.070
can’t leave each other alone

00:22:54.230 --> 00:22:58.740
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star!

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:02.950
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and DIE!

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:05.330
Test my heart, don’t stop

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:12.420
Let’s go! Dream on! No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:16.760
We’re a happy family La la la

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:20.930
Let me say, I love you!!

00:23:21.090 --> 00:23:23.390
When all is said and done

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:28.100
I’m home! Welcome back, it’s hot pot tonight!

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:32.770
Come, gather everyone! Let’s enjoy this meal!

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:35.030
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.700
What next? What next? In the end, Wakeup!

00:23:41.740 --> 00:23:47.120
A girl constantly hiding her face from the world
now walks confidently under the light.

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:49.830
However, this happiness did not last long.

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:55.000
Dropkick on My Devil!
We'll suicide dive into your heart in the next episode too!
